    "institutions_today": [],
    "paragraph": "This study classified the functional roles of 3,207 bicycle sharing stations in Tokyo using 15-minute interval availability data across three seasons between autumn 2023 and spring 2024. Another paper presents a comparative narrative review of literature published between 2000 and 2025 on land-use/land-cover changes and urban heat dynamics in Jaipur and Ahmedabad, India. Finally, a comparative analysis of two European greening projects in Malmö, Sweden, and Rotterdam, the Netherlands, evaluates how institutional governance, policy frameworks, and ex-ante equity indicators affect green gentrification.",
